{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109512","id":2734211465,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6i-MGJ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109512","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109512.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109512.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109512","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109512/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109512/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109512/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/67723a95725c70c76dcac2de3a5d7b46f0ea80df","number":109512,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Speed up very large `Trees`","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes one of the issues in #107123.\r\n\r\nThe `SceneTreeDock` `Tree` ends up being one of the main sources of lag on large scenes. The three bottlenecks end up being `create_child`, `_is_sibling_branch_selected`, and text shaping. \r\n- `create_child` can benefit greatly from the `children_cache` that already exists, it just needs to use it.\r\n- `_is_sibling_branch_selected` is called wastefully, causing O(n^2) behavior on the number of siblings. If we only call it when the value might have changed, we can turn it into O(n) total across all calls, instead. \r\n- Text shaping improvements are handled in #109516\r\n\r\nHere's a flamegraph from #107123 showing the `create_child` bottleneck (with PR #109514 already applied to handle the other problem):\r\n<img width=\"2513\" height=\"1280\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/10773141-bbaa-41d9-b229-68029ac0ae62\" />\r\n\r\nHere's the after:\r\n<img width=\"2530\" height=\"1329\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f175dc71-a79d-4597-a3d2-96c3d1826754\" />\r\n\r\nThe `create_child` bottleneck came up a lot and could be pretty bad, sometimes upwards of 20 second editor hangs. The `is_sibling_branch_selected` slowdown was never the primary bottleneck, but once `create_child` was patched it did represent ~10% of cpu time on a couple operations and was a pretty clean change, so I included it.\r\n\r\n---------------------\r\n\r\nAll performance tests were run on builds made with the following command: `scons optimize=speed_trace debug_symbols=yes platform=linuxbsd dev_build=no production=yes`","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGF